        "### C. Pertanyaan Komputasional\n",
        "\n",
        "11. **Soal:** Implementasikan fungsi Python `bayes_theorem(prior, likelihood, total_prob)` yang mengembalikan nilai posterior.\n",
        "\n",
        "    - **Solusi:**\n",
        "\n",
        "    ``` python\n",
        "    def bayes_theorem(prior, likelihood, neg_likelihood):  \n",
        "    # neg_likelihood adalah P(B|Not A)  \n",
        "    p_b = (likelihood * prior) + (neg_likelihood * (1 - prior))  \n",
        "    return (likelihood * prior) / p_b  \n",
        "    ```\n",
